          <div class="ofac-faq-item"><div class="views-field views-field-field-topic"><div class="field-content"><div class="treas-text--h2"><strong><a href="/faqs/topic/5671 ">Chinese Military Companies Sanctions</a></strong></div></div></div><div><h1 class="font-sans-lg text-ls-auto text-bold">899.&nbsp;What entities are subject to Executive Order (E.O.) 13959, as amended, and when do the prohibitions against such entities go into effect?  
</h1></div></div>

